<title>PORTUGAL: TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ESTORIL, Portugal 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results</p>
<p>of the $625,000 Estoril Open men's tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix numbers denote seeding):</p>
<p>6-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 6-4</p>
<p>4-6 6-1</p>
<p>Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat Nuno Marques (Portugal) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>8-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Frederic Fontang (France) 6-4 3-6</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat Francisco Cabello (Argentina) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
